# EventType: 1160000005
# Descriptor: [B0 -> K_S0 nu anti-nu]cc
# NickName: Bd_KS0nunubar
# Documentation: Rare b->s nu anti-nu process, decays to only reconstructed final state
# Tested: Yes
# PhysicsWG: EWP
# Responsible: Giulio Dujany
# Email: giulio.dujany@iphc.cnrs.fr
# Cuts: None
# Date: 20260715

Alias K_S0sig K_S0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.00 B0sig anti-B0sig B0 anti-B0         VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay B0sig
1.0 K_S0sig nu_e anti-nu_e                   KNUNU;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-B0sig

Decay K_S0sig
1.0    pi- pi+ PHSP;
Enddecay

End